--> create build:
on the package directory, type:
$ python -m build

a folder will be created: dist

--> upload package
$ python -m twine upload --repository testpypi dist/*
login: __token__
password: your token

To create login and get token:
https://test.pypi.org/manage/account/#api-tokens
- scope: entire account

--> install your package:
pip install -i https://test.pypi.org/simple/ lala==0.0.1

--> have fun!
python 
>>> import lala.starwars as sw
>>> sw.starwars()



